# Text files are LF in the repo and in every checkout, Windows included. StyLua (stylua.toml
# line_endings = "Unix") fails every file of a Windows clone that Git converted to CRLF, which is what
# Git for Windows does by default (core.autocrlf = true). Binary files (FBX, glTF, PNG, .rbxm) are
# detected by `text=auto` and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
